OL,3,GNEWSABereaved parents in Three Peaks
OL,4,Aboiler challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey wanted to raise funds for the
OL,7,Fbereavement suite and Tulip Room quiet
OL,8,Fspace at the Royal Hallamshire
OL,9,FHospital, following the loss of their
OL,10,Fdaughter Ophelia, who was born at 34
OL,11,Fweeks in March.
OL,13,FOliver, 38, said carrying the 4st
OL,14,F(25kg) boiler represented the "weight
OL,15,Fof grief" felt by bereaved families.
